// nova_tcluster_service.nova
// NovaX Ternary Cluster Manager -- NovaLang port of nova_tcluster.py
//
// Service cluster orchestration micro-tool. Manages groups of related
// services as named clusters with tier-based startup ordering, rolling
// restarts, and dependency-aware shutdown.
//
// Clusters are the organizational unit above individual services. Each
// cluster groups services that collaborate on a function (AI, storage,
// security, etc.) and assigns them a startup tier. Tier 1 boots first,
// tier 5 last. Shutdown reverses: tier 5 dies first, tier 1 last.
//
// Rolling restart stops one service at a time, waits for health
// confirmation before proceeding to the next -- zero-downtime within
// a cluster.
//
// Port: 9971
// Harmonics: 3-5-7-13

// -- Server bootstrap ---------------------------------------------------------

// -- Shared Libraries (N-S Flow) --
